{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hi Deborah, it's been a while! Since we last talked, so much has happened. Balancing engineering school with my partner's video games is quite a feat. But I'm also setting aside time for myself, doing yoga and meditation. It helps give me calm amidst the craziness."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-7048d5f3c82df1ae713c92f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.419495+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7048d5f3c82df1ae713c92f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7048d5f3c82df1ae713c92f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene! Great to hear from you. Taking a break is key. How have those practices been helping with everything?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-150ac1d12baa6476b1299e17", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.442721+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "150ac1d12baa6476b1299e17", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "150ac1d12baa6476b1299e17", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: They seriously saved me. I chill out and gain perspective when I do yoga. Afterward, I'm more alert and motivated. Here is my last photo."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-469c5e05a2942d5c9c249f5d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.455452+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "469c5e05a2942d5c9c249f5d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "469c5e05a2942d5c9c249f5d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Wow, cool that yoga has been helping you out! Do they also do yoga with you? Does your partner do yoga with you?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-510f73c22159627cbe9b441c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.466621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "510f73c22159627cbe9b441c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "510f73c22159627cbe9b441c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: He started joining me sometimes, which is nice for bonding and relaxing. It's brought us closer. This is just our random photo."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-7d4d35a5678d91cd3a8a8fa1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.477515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d4d35a5678d91cd3a8a8fa1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d4d35a5678d91cd3a8a8fa1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Aw, that's wonderful! How long have you been married?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-a7c82622e936490332adde0d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.490814+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a7c82622e936490332adde0d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a7c82622e936490332adde0d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: We're not married yet but we've been together for three years. We're taking it slow and loving the ride. This ring on his hand is just a decoration, not a wedding ring."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-2f805070071a8aa1a0d44f94", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.500959+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2f805070071a8aa1a0d44f94", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2f805070071a8aa1a0d44f94", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Sounds nice, Jolene. Enjoying the journey is the main thing. So, how did you two meet?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-0bb06ee5e5d1ada01680020a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.514578+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0bb06ee5e5d1ada01680020a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0bb06ee5e5d1ada01680020a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: We actually met in an engineering class in college and quickly became friends. It eventually blossomed into something more and it's been great!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-d35d20a18544afdb55261903", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.525580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d35d20a18544afdb55261903", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d35d20a18544afdb55261903", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Wow, your relationship started from a strong friendship. Do you still enjoy working on engineering projects together?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-aec0cdf03d7f031aa5a83bdb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.537583+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aec0cdf03d7f031aa5a83bdb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aec0cdf03d7f031aa5a83bdb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yep, teaming up for these projects feels great! We get each other's struggles and both love it."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-ab0d67cf4f5d78ced9bdee19", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.548793+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ab0d67cf4f5d78ced9bdee19", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ab0d67cf4f5d78ced9bdee19", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Have yoga or meditation helped with any stress?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-53dd6ea4ae9dd3799873b41e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.561953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53dd6ea4ae9dd3799873b41e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53dd6ea4ae9dd3799873b41e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Whenever I'm overwhelmed, I just take a break and do some breathing or meditate. It really helps me feel calmer and clearer, so I'm able to handle challenges more easily."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-fdb695c4ed17f5f4e97e004d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.570056+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fdb695c4ed17f5f4e97e004d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fdb695c4ed17f5f4e97e004d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's been great to see your progress since we last chatted - keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-5772ac8c7b3ca4fc84e74898", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.582637+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5772ac8c7b3ca4fc84e74898", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5772ac8c7b3ca4fc84e74898", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! Your support really means a lot. I'm gonna keep pushing forward and continue taking time for myself."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-877f843f548cecd39b51562d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.593819+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "877f843f548cecd39b51562d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "877f843f548cecd39b51562d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Always rooting for you. Remember to listen to your heart and take good care. Here's a photo I took while reflecting outdoors. It's a reminder to find peace even in chaos."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-9adbf3c9dadc72a03967f9c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.605062+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9adbf3c9dadc72a03967f9c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9adbf3c9dadc72a03967f9c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm curious, what does your daily routine look like?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-b893a52d4a9a708f8b9841a4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.615062+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b893a52d4a9a708f8b9841a4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b893a52d4a9a708f8b9841a4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: In the morning, I meditate, do yoga, and teach classes. And yesterday I went for a morning jog for the first time in a nearby park. I will now incorporate this into my daily routine. And in the evenings, I spend time with loved ones."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-fea7985f6733c3165e69e751", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.626227+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fea7985f6733c3165e69e751", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fea7985f6733c3165e69e751", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Why did you decide that?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-2ae7345dd760d3a0094cae9f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.641232+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ae7345dd760d3a0094cae9f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ae7345dd760d3a0094cae9f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Exercise is key for me - it makes me feel connected to my body."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-6faad8fa41ad3cf16e29df24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.651741+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6faad8fa41ad3cf16e29df24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6faad8fa41ad3cf16e29df24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: This is a great healthy habit!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-ae6bee62847e6a4ac5a77d81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.660738+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ae6bee62847e6a4ac5a77d81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ae6bee62847e6a4ac5a77d81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's like they say - \"Can't pour from an empty cup.\" Looking out for ourselves gives us the energy to help others. And don't forget, you're worth it too!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-bba0c8837fc75a71f133a29f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.669848+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bba0c8837fc75a71f133a29f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bba0c8837fc75a71f133a29f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb. Your words really mean something to me. I'll keep remembering to prioritize self-care."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-48/session_7-4a6c647b88b7a64bc5ff25cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:21:30.681350+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a6c647b88b7a64bc5ff25cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a6c647b88b7a64bc5ff25cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
